{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 38,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 229.215,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.068,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My son,",
      "verse": "38:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 1.248,
      "end": 2.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "give ear to my words,",
      "verse": "38:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 3.146,
      "end": 12.48,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I say unto you, even as I said unto Helaman, that inasmuch as ye shall keep the commandments of God ye shall prosper in the land;",
      "verse": "38:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 12.66,
      "end": 16.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and inasmuch as ye will not keep the commandments of God",
      "verse": "38:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 16.184,
      "end": 18.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall be cut off from his presence.",
      "verse": "38:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 19.186,
      "end": 20.579,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son,",
      "verse": "38:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.759,
      "end": 27.121,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I trust that I shall have great joy in you, because of your steadiness and your faithfulness unto God;",
      "verse": "38:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 27.301,
      "end": 30.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for as you have commenced in your youth to look to the Lord your God,",
      "verse": "38:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 30.918,
      "end": 35.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so I hope that you will continue in keeping his commandments;",
      "verse": "38:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 35.278,
      "end": 38.157,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for blessed is he that endureth to the end.",
      "verse": "38:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 38.837,
      "end": 40.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you, my son,",
      "verse": "38:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 40.828,
      "end": 47.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I have had great joy in thee already, because of thy faithfulness and thy diligence, and thy patience",
      "verse": "38:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 48.16,
      "end": 51.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thy long-suffering among the people of the Zoramites.",
      "verse": "38:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 51.951,
      "end": 54.18,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I know that thou wast in bonds;",
      "verse": "38:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 54.36,
      "end": 58.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and I also know that thou wast stoned for the word's sake;",
      "verse": "38:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 58.627,
      "end": 61.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou didst bear all these things with patience",
      "verse": "38:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 61.593,
      "end": 63.404,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because the Lord was with thee;",
      "verse": "38:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 63.584,
      "end": 66.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and now thou knowest that the Lord did deliver thee.",
      "verse": "38:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 67.283,
      "end": 68.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now my son,",
      "verse": "38:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 68.856,
      "end": 74.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Shiblon, I would that ye should remember, that as much as ye shall put your trust in God",
      "verse": "38:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 74.423,
      "end": 77.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so much ye shall be delivered out of your trials,",
      "verse": "38:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 78.179,
      "end": 80.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your troubles, and your afflictions,",
      "verse": "38:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 81.145,
      "end": 83.699,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye shall be lifted up at the last day.",
      "verse": "38:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 84.379,
      "end": 85.586,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, my son,",
      "verse": "38:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 85.766,
      "end": 89.667,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would not that ye should think that I know these things of myself,",
      "verse": "38:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 89.847,
      "end": 94.863,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but it is the Spirit of God which is in me which maketh these things known unto me;",
      "verse": "38:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 95.043,
      "end": 97.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for if I had not been born of God",
      "verse": "38:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 97.684,
      "end": 99.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I should not have known these things.",
      "verse": "38:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 100.268,
      "end": 105.005,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, the Lord in his great mercy sent his angel to declare unto me",
      "verse": "38:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 105.185,
      "end": 108.854,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I must stop the work of destruction among his people;",
      "verse": "38:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 109.034,
      "end": 111.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and I have seen an angel face to face,",
      "verse": "38:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 112.0,
      "end": 113.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he spake with me,",
      "verse": "38:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 113.62,
      "end": 115.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his voice was as thunder,",
      "verse": "38:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 115.704,
      "end": 117.469,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it shook the whole earth.",
      "verse": "38:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 118.149,
      "end": 125.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I was three days and three nights in the most bitter pain and anguish of soul;",
      "verse": "38:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 126.131,
      "end": 130.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and never, until I did cry out unto the Lord Jesus Christ for mercy,",
      "verse": "38:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 130.769,
      "end": 133.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did I receive a remission of my sins.",
      "verse": "38:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 133.596,
      "end": 137.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I did cry unto him and I did find peace to my soul.",
      "verse": "38:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 138.316,
      "end": 139.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son,",
      "verse": "38:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 139.889,
      "end": 141.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have told you this",
      "verse": "38:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 141.648,
      "end": 143.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may learn wisdom,",
      "verse": "38:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 143.686,
      "end": 145.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may learn of me",
      "verse": "38:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 145.724,
      "end": 150.229,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there is no other way or means whereby man can be saved,",
      "verse": "38:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 150.409,
      "end": 152.127,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "only in and through Christ.",
      "verse": "38:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 152.307,
      "end": 155.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, he is the life and the light of the world.",
      "verse": "38:9",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 155.366,
      "end": 158.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, he is the word of truth and righteousness.",
      "verse": "38:9",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 158.879,
      "end": 161.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, as ye have begun to teach the word",
      "verse": "38:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 161.753,
      "end": 164.957,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so I would that ye should continue to teach;",
      "verse": "38:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 165.137,
      "end": 169.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I would that ye would be diligent and temperate in all things.",
      "verse": "38:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 170.089,
      "end": 173.015,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "See that ye are not lifted up unto pride;",
      "verse": "38:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 173.195,
      "end": 177.978,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, see that ye do not boast in your own wisdom, nor of your much strength.",
      "verse": "38:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 178.658,
      "end": 181.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Use boldness, but not overbearance;",
      "verse": "38:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 181.346,
      "end": 184.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also see that ye bridle all your passions,",
      "verse": "38:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 184.637,
      "end": 186.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may be filled with love;",
      "verse": "38:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 187.046,
      "end": 189.368,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "see that ye refrain from idleness.",
      "verse": "38:12",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 190.048,
      "end": 192.277,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do not pray as the Zoramites do,",
      "verse": "38:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 192.457,
      "end": 195.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye have seen that they pray to be heard of men,",
      "verse": "38:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 196.074,
      "end": 198.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to be praised for their wisdom.",
      "verse": "38:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 199.169,
      "end": 200.284,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do not say:",
      "verse": "38:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 200.464,
      "end": 201.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O God,",
      "verse": "38:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 201.573,
      "end": 204.638,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I thank thee that we are better than our brethren;",
      "verse": "38:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 204.818,
      "end": 208.487,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but rather say: O Lord, forgive my unworthiness,",
      "verse": "38:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 208.667,
      "end": 211.035,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and remember my brethren in mercy\u2014",
      "verse": "38:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 211.215,
      "end": 214.466,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, acknowledge your unworthiness before God at all times.",
      "verse": "38:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 215.146,
      "end": 217.189,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And may the Lord bless your soul,",
      "verse": "38:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 217.369,
      "end": 222.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and receive you at the last day into his kingdom, to sit down in peace.",
      "verse": "38:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 222.332,
      "end": 225.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now go, my son, and teach the word unto this people.",
      "verse": "38:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 225.949,
      "end": 227.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Be sober.",
      "verse": "38:15",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 227.244,
      "end": 228.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My son, farewell.",
      "verse": "38:15",
      "lineIndex": 71
    }
  ]
}